  "parsed_answer": "Minoxidil\u2019s exact mechanism for hair-growth is not fully known, but the main proposed actions are:\n\n- **Opens potassium channels** in hair follicles and surrounding cells, which may help prolong the growth phase of the hair cycle (**anagen**).\n- **Increases blood flow** locally to the scalp by causing vasodilation, though this is probably not the main reason it works.\n- **Stimulates hair follicle activity**, helping follicles produce thicker, longer hairs and possibly increasing follicle size.\n\nIn short: **Minoxidil promotes and prolongs hair growth, likely by acting on hair follicle cycling and cellular signaling rather than simply by improving blood flow**.",
